Built the native Track A generator, but it is not yet oracle-certified.

- [Generator](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1612.00719/gen_1612_00719.py:22): inverse-generated integral solutions to the paper’s one-quadratic/two-cubic Theorem 1 regime.
