- [Bare transcript](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1612.00719/llm_loop_transcript.jsonl), [hinted transcript](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1612.00719/g9_hinted_transcript.jsonl), and [placebo transcript](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1612.00719/g9_placebo_transcript.jsonl) were produced by `harden.py`.

The external blocker is OpenRouter: every call returned HTTP 403, “Key limit exceeded,” before inference. These were correctly recorded as errors—not model failures—so no hardness verdict or G9 comparison is claimed. No `REJECTED.md` was written because the family itself has not failed.

