codex
The first redesigned cubic identity exposed exactly the kind of planting leak the adversary gate is meant to catch: both residual-greedy and local sign-flip search solved 8/8 because one closing vector balanced all the others. I’m replacing that star-shaped relation with a balanced strictly convex telescoping polygon. Consecutive determinant signs still give the compact invariant, but no single dominant term reveals the planted orientation.
apply patch
